    <item>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 13:37:17 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Your 2024 HR Conference is tomorrow!</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">62772220</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3bdd3fc</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/10/10322583/hr-govdelivery-banner-020124_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="HR Banner - 10.10.24" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/10/10393969/2024-coc-hr-conference-clipart_original.png" style="width: 546px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="2024 HR Conference LOGO" width="546" height="780"></td></tr></table>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; margin: 30px 0;">Hello HR Partners,</h3>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Looking forward to seeing you all at tomorrow's 2024 HR Conference!  This event will take place at Columbus State Community College's Mitchell Hall Event Space (2nd floor) located at 250 Cleveland Avenue, Columbus, Ohio 43215.  The conference will run from 9:00 a.m. to 3:30 p.m. with morning registration and continental breakfast at 8:15 a.m.</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/10/10394236/other_original.png" style="width: 460px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Other" width="460" height="22"><ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Parking instructions for the venue are attached:  please send this to your phone or print these now as you'll need the special code to park tomorrow!</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">We are partnering with Dress For Success and My Brother's Closet to accept clothing donations at this year's conference.  Bring new or gently used office attire to the conference and we will take care of the rest!</li>
</ul>
<a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2024/10/23/file_attachments/3042836/%24%20donation.PNG" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/10/10394528/donation_original.png" style="width: 456px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="$ donation" width="456" height="31"></a><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/10/10394556/qr-codes_original.png" style="width: 351px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="QR Code" width="351" height="131"></td></tr></table>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Questions?</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Please contact Jennie Hanna at (614)645-8978, or <a href="mailto:JNHanna@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">JNHanna@columbus.gov</a>. </p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2024/10/23/file_attachments/3042715/CSCC%20Mitchell%20Hall%20parking%20code%20instructions.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CSCC Mitchell Hall parking code instructions.pdf</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

