<div id="abe-column-block-c26a34bb-1cfd-48ec-8205-e6c43c88a41a" class="abe-column-block" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="125977313" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;">
  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-c26a34bb-1cfd-48ec-8205-e6c43c88a41a-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 5px; border: none;">
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Greetings City of Columbus Employees,</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Get ready to <strong>LEARN | GROW | THRIVE</strong> this fall with Citywide Training &amp; Development's latest course catalog! We are thrilled to offer a diverse range of in-person and virtual courses designed to empower you with the skills and knowledge needed to excel in your career. Visit <strong><a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">the Training Gateway</a></strong> today to view or complete classes!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Here's a glimpse of what awaits you:</p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">
<strong>Sharpen Your Leadership Skills:</strong> Whether you're a new supervisor or a seasoned leader, our Supervisor Series offers tailored programs to refine your management abilities. Choose from our Pre-, New, or Seasoned Supervisor series, each designed to address the unique challenges you face.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">
<strong>Become a Communication Powerhouse</strong>: Effective communication is crucial for success. Our courses on communication skills, giving &amp; receiving feedback, and verbal de-escalation will equip you with the tools to navigate challenging conversations and foster positive workplace relationships.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<strong>Prioritize Your Well-being</strong>: Invest in your personal and professional growth with courses designed to enhance your emotional intelligence and resilience. Learn how to manage your emotions, discover techniques for persevering through challenging times, and understand the importance of psychological safety in the workplace.</li>
</ul>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>What’s in it for you?</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">
<strong>Expert Guidance</strong>: Our courses are led by experienced instructors who provide practical knowledge and valuable insights gained from years of experience.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">
<strong>Flexibility</strong>: Choose in-person or virtual classes to fit your schedule and learning style.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<strong>Opportunity</strong>: Investing in your professional development is an investment in your future. Enhance your skills and unlock new opportunities.</li>
</ul>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>Ready to Embark on Your Learning Journey?</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">
<strong>Explore the complete Fall Quarter Course Catalog: <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/files/sharedassets/city/v/1/human-resources/ctd/catalogs/coc-employee-2024-fall-quarterly-catalog.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">CoC EE – 2024 Fall Quarterly Catalog</a></strong>.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">
<strong>Registration is Easy:</strong> Sign up for courses through <strong><a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">the Training Gateway/Cornerstone</a></strong> using your six-digit Dayforce ID as your username.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<strong>Get Support</strong>: Contact our team at <a href="mailto:CTD@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">CTD@columbus.gov</a> or call 614-645-8294 if you have any questions or need technical assistance.</li>
</ul>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">We look forward to welcoming you to an enriching and rewarding learning experience!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Sincerely,</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">The Citywide Training &amp; Development Team<br><a href="mailto:CTD@columbus.gov" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">CTD@columbus.gov</a><br>614-645-8294</p>
