    <item>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 14:46:22 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Reminder! Join us at the 2024 Employee Health and Benefits Fair ~ Tuesday, September 17, 2024 from 10a-4p</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">62188959</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3b4ed9f</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/02/8971610/hr-govdelivery-banner-final-020924_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="HR GovDelivery Banner FEB 2024" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">The Department of Human Resources is hosting its annual Employee Health and Benefits Fair!</h1>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">This exciting event is dedicated to promoting the health and well-being of all City of Columbus employees. At the fair, you'll have access to various resources to help you live a healthier lifestyle and maximize your City of Columbus benefits.</p>
<p class="ql-align-center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">We hope you take advantage of this opportunity to invest in your health and wellness and look forward to seeing you there!</p>
<h2 class="ql-align-center" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><em>**NEW THIS YEAR -- &gt; FOOD TRUCKS!**</em></strong></h2>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Click the links below to view the shuttle schedules:</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/files/sharedassets/city/v/4/human-resources/health-and-benefit-fair/1111-east-broad-240-parsons-shuttle-schedule.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">1111 E. Broad St. and 240 Parsons Ave.</a></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/files/sharedassets/city/v/1/human-resources/health-and-benefit-fair/910-dublin-rd-shuttle-schedule.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"> 910 Dublin Rd.</a></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><em>(Note: the shuttle schedules are available on the Employee Benefits and Wellness <u>intranet</u> page under “Employee Benefits links”, and also when you register)</em></p>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"> </h2>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">
<strong>SCAN THE CODE BELOW TO REGISTER FOR THE EVENT or </strong><strong><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/fa2a5528fe1a47b995416134f312806b?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: none; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CLICK HERE</a></strong>
</h2>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/09/10129711/5687705/official-invite-draft-1_crop.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="HBF poster" width="560" height="725">
</td>
</tr>
